Upstream attribution:

The plugin is an integration, not a fork. It invokes CodeGraph, a separate
project with its own release cadence, as a child process over its CLI.
CodeGraph is neither vendored, bundled nor redistributed here; it must be
installed separately (`npm i -g @colbymchenry/codegraph`).

